# Generated by training/build_dataset.py -- fully deterministic (no
# randomness) from the committed raw records, so it's a derived artifact,
# not a source of truth. Regenerate with:
#   python -m training.build_dataset Data/Dataset Data
Data/dataset_ds1.csv
Data/dataset_ds2.csv

# Versioned model artifacts (training/train.py) -- large binaries,
# regeneratable from the dataset + a fixed seed via `python -m training.train`.
# Lowercase deliberately: on a case-insensitive filesystem (e.g. macOS/APFS)
# this folder physically shares a directory with any capitalized `Models/`
# path some other tool might create -- don't merge the two or rename either
# one without checking git's case-sensitive match. (The original pre-rebuild
# PyQt app's `Models/` artifacts that used to collide here are now retired,
# not tracked at all -- see docs/progress.md.)
models/
